flowchart LR
    U["UPDATE row"] --> V1["new version written, old stays (dead tuple)"]
    V1 --> DT[Dead tuples accumulate]
    DT -->|threshold| AV[Autovacuum worker]
    AV --> CLEAN[Space marked reusable]
    AV --> FREEZE[Freeze XIDs - wraparound defense]
    LONG[Long transaction pins horizon] -.->|blocks cleanup| AV
    CLEAN --> FSM[Space reused by writes]
